From earlier {{m|en|cumrade}}, {{m|en|camrade}}, {{m|en|comerade}}, {{m|en|camerade}}, {{m|en|camarade}}, from {{bor|en|frm|camarade}}, from {{der|en|es|camarada}} or {{der|en|it|camerata|t=chamber mate}}, from {{der|en|la-med|*camarata}}, from {{der|en|la|camara}}, {{m|la|camera|t=vaulted room, chamber}}; see {{m|en|chamber}}. Compare {{m|en|camaraderie}} and {{m|en|chamberlain}}.

